{"version":1,"content":"<p>受暖空氣沿列島南側的太平洋高壓邊緣流入影響，日本多地錄得罕見高溫，三重縣尾鷲市測得31.5℃、大阪府八尾市測得31.2℃。</p><p>氣象廳指出，10月下旬仍錄得如此高溫屬罕見，提醒民眾雖已入秋，仍須提高警覺，慎防中暑。</p><p>（共同社/讀賣新聞）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T08:59:27.360154+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:20:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T20:37:37.012214+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:57:40.887499+00:00","content_hash":"9113467c571b1bdb4aaa23b073b29258eb994bce71a1832e3a3676617be6dd28","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}